# Optional non-secret FastAPI origin used for the SACHET CAP and CPCB station
# panels and for the AI Assistant chat endpoint.
# Leave unset for the standalone GitHub Pages/Open-Meteo deployment — the
# official panels and the AI Assistant then show explicit "not configured"
# setup notices instead of substituting any data or replies.
# Local example: VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
# Production example: VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.org
# Never put DATA_GOV_IN_API_KEY, ASSISTANT_API_KEY, database passwords, sensor
# keys, or other secrets here.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
